cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DDC CWICR data or code, please cite it as below."
title: "DDC CWICR - Construction Work Items, Costs & Resources"
abstract: >-
  A multilingual construction cost and resource database that
  harmonises nine national and regional cost bases into one
  95-column schema: the CIS resource-based norm system (GESN /
  FER / TER) in 30 language and market editions, plus eight
  national bases from Turkey, China, Brazil, Spain, Italy,
  Vietnam, Indonesia and Greece. Each base ships in its native
  language and English, with compact resource catalogs repriced
  by World Bank PPP and translated for 48 target markets, and
  pre-built vector embeddings for semantic search over the CIS
  editions. Compiled, translated, and harmonised for
  cross-regional and cross-language comparability in AEC cost
  estimation, Bill of Quantities preparation, and AI agent
  workflows. Distributed under a dual licence: the datasets under
  CC BY-NC 4.0 and the accompanying workflows / adapter scripts
  under Apache-2.0.
